NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY TOOLS

The MIT licence above covers the OmniOmics application: its interface, its
workflow definitions, and its analysis and plotting scripts.

It does NOT cover the bioinformatics tools OmniOmics orchestrates. Those are
installed at run time into isolated conda environments and remain under their
own licences, several of which are more restrictive than this one (GPL-3.0 and
academic-use-only terms both appear among them). Databases downloaded through
the Databases tab likewise carry their own terms of use.

Anyone redistributing OmniOmics, or using it in work that is itself
redistributed, is responsible for checking the licence of each tool and
database actually enabled in their runs. docs/CITATIONS.md lists every tool
with its reference.
